      <div class="section-label">聽起來熟悉嗎</div>
      <h2 class="scene-title">房子買了<br>現在不知道從哪開始</h2>
      <div class="pain-list">
        <div class="pain-item land-anim">
          <div class="pain-num">01</div>
          <div class="pain-content">
